<h2 data-wf-id="62b7e84c-4b8a-15d7-38e9-c476f2834312" data-w-id="62b7e84c-4b8a-15d7-38e9-c476f2834312">
Existing software is a partial view, the comprehensive plant model doesn’t exist.
</h2>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="4cde76db-0378-db5f-c108-cf642a6895b9" data-w-id="4cde76db-0378-db5f-c108-cf642a6895b9" class="problem_header-divide"></div>
<div data-wf-id="c29483cf-9b27-e45e-472b-c9df589ae52f" data-w-id="c29483cf-9b27-e45e-472b-c9df589ae52f" class="max-width-586">
<p data-wf-id="5214c2e9-105e-e3be-7808-85bfba306ffd" data-w-id="5214c2e9-105e-e3be-7808-85bfba306ffd">
The context needed to drive every decision at a plant, is siloed across schematics, bespoke applications, and engineering minds. Nothing is retained in context to the plant itself.
</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
