<div data-wf-id="3eb7c659-6d59-14c2-4cb6-dec668e7a7f2" data-w-id="3eb7c659-6d59-14c2-4cb6-dec668e7a7f2" class="padding-vertical padding-100">
<div data-wf-id="3238c735-1df2-d111-5b5e-dd3c7a3d5f53" data-w-id="3238c735-1df2-d111-5b5e-dd3c7a3d5f53" class="container">
<div data-wf-id="0bae3a31-dcd4-bdfc-558f-a2ac968e5265" data-w-id="0bae3a31-dcd4-bdfc-558f-a2ac968e5265" class="flex_vertical-center text-align-center">
<div data-wf-id="753c3fd2-00f1-c1d7-3f8d-30972f9ff13c" data-w-id="753c3fd2-00f1-c1d7-3f8d-30972f9ff13c" class="margin-bottom margin-18">
<GTag>
PlantGraph
</GTag>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="00a0c33b-a4c3-9602-4c9d-fbb2a87f6d32" data-w-id="00a0c33b-a4c3-9602-4c9d-fbb2a87f6d32" class="margin-bottom margin-12">
<h2 data-wf-id="56ca2edf-70fa-24f8-df33-d1b20fde7072" data-w-id="56ca2edf-70fa-24f8-df33-d1b20fde7072">
One plant, many lenses.
</h2>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="cb234d29-cca1-6021-44d3-e95943369872" data-w-id="cb234d29-cca1-6021-44d3-e95943369872" class="margin-bottom margin-64">
<div data-wf-id="4f7feed6-f50b-2de0-b2ba-4b91917222e2" data-w-id="4f7feed6-f50b-2de0-b2ba-4b91917222e2" class="max-width-700">
<p data-wf-id="e2c4673d-8cde-0f02-05fd-b8ce1764c05a" data-w-id="e2c4673d-8cde-0f02-05fd-b8ce1764c05a">
PlantGraph turns your existing drawings into a connected model of the entire plant: every piece of equipment, line, and valve, and how material and energy flow between them, creating a Plant Context Infrastructure.
</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="1e4fd945-8059-1646-9639-4799281343ff" data-w-id="1e4fd945-8059-1646-9639-4799281343ff" class="plantgraph_grid">
<div id="w-node-_6c3a3391-1308-7e11-55bf-7e51e18c4b10-40d5b052" data-wf-id="6c3a3391-1308-7e11-55bf-7e51e18c4b10" data-w-id="6c3a3391-1308-7e11-55bf-7e51e18c4b10" class="plantgraph_cards is-medium">
<div data-wf-id="d5afaf88-c0d3-8fdc-869d-db14142a1fb2" data-w-id="d5afaf88-c0d3-8fdc-869d-db14142a1fb2" class="plantgraph_img">
<img src={__lumosAsset15} loading="lazy" alt="" data-wf-id="48f445d6-cef4-4a47-6a6c-665e8eb06b9c" data-w-id="48f445d6-cef4-4a47-6a6c-665e8eb06b9c" />
</div>
<div data-wf-id="3d47c69c-bf18-d23a-e172-048a192bb57c" data-w-id="3d47c69c-bf18-d23a-e172-048a192bb57c" class="max-width-510">
<div data-wf-id="ef192439-76e3-6734-7bc1-ada84942ff11" data-w-id="ef192439-76e3-6734-7bc1-ada84942ff11" class="margin-bottom margin-12">
<h3 data-wf-id="46e67099-49a1-f5ec-fb16-e793060051e8" data-w-id="46e67099-49a1-f5ec-fb16-e793060051e8" class="heading-style-h5">
The whole plant, connected.
</h3>
</div>
<p data-wf-id="8ea3bdd9-68d8-723a-d775-3db03f45b07b" data-w-id="8ea3bdd9-68d8-723a-d775-3db03f45b07b" class="body-3 text-color-iron">
Search flow across your entire plant. Pick any two points and see every line, valve, and flange between them, across every drawing.
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962a9" data-w-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962a9" class="plantgraph_cards">
<img src={__lumosAsset15} alt="" data-wf-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962aa" data-w-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962aa" />
<div data-wf-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962ab" data-w-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962ab" class="plantgraph_content">
<h3 data-wf-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962ac" data-w-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962ac" class="heading-style-h5">
Find anything.
</h3>
<p data-wf-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962ae" data-w-id="a58a3e6d-b292-bcf4-ff22-f014a23962ae" class="body-3">
A search engine for your plant. Search all your data through the lens of the plant, so every result shows up in the context of the equipment and flow around it.
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb46" data-w-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb46" class="plantgraph_cards">
<img src={__lumosAsset15} alt="" data-wf-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb47" data-w-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb47" />
<div data-wf-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb48" data-w-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb48" class="plantgraph_content">
<h3 data-wf-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb49" data-w-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb49" class="heading-style-h5">
Add what you know.
</h3>
<p data-wf-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb4b" data-w-id="4f73c4f9-7a4d-5af2-e542-e4a0ba1ceb4b" class="body-3">
Define instrument loops, isolation plans, systems, etc. right inside the model. And when you do, everyone else can find them.
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d08" data-w-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d08" class="plantgraph_cards">
<img src={__lumosAsset15} alt="" data-wf-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d09" data-w-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d09" />
<div data-wf-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d0a" data-w-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d0a" class="plantgraph_content">
<h3 data-wf-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d0b" data-w-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d0b" class="heading-style-h5">
It looks like your plant.
</h3>
<p data-wf-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d0d" data-w-id="4a0c80f0-4c39-8806-6e30-bea42e928d0d" class="body-3">
Use the same CAD symbols and diagrams engineers already use, the configuration of the equipment, and the orientation of where they are relative to each other.
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df69" data-w-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df69" class="plantgraph_cards">
<img src={__lumosAsset15} alt="" data-wf-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df6a" data-w-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df6a" />
<div data-wf-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df6b" data-w-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df6b" class="plantgraph_content">
<h3 data-wf-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df6c" data-w-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df6c" class="heading-style-h5">
Always current.
</h3>
<p data-wf-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df6e" data-w-id="9daaf1ca-ab11-7703-e20d-c63be926df6e" class="body-3">
When the plant changes, PlantGraph changes with it, and so does everything your teams have added. Loops, circuits, notes, and plans stay accurate and versioned, so knowledge never goes stale.
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div id="w-node-_256092c6-9305-38cf-1998-73803e17ec8f-40d5b052" data-wf-id="256092c6-9305-38cf-1998-73803e17ec8f" data-w-id="256092c6-9305-38cf-1998-73803e17ec8f" class="plantgraph_cards is-large">
<div data-wf-id="a30b53a9-8d93-22bf-d534-87a8a395b66b" data-w-id="a30b53a9-8d93-22bf-d534-87a8a395b66b" class="max-width-510">
<div data-wf-id="a30b53a9-8d93-22bf-d534-87a8a395b66c" data-w-id="a30b53a9-8d93-22bf-d534-87a8a395b66c" class="margin-bottom margin-12">
<h3 data-wf-id="a30b53a9-8d93-22bf-d534-87a8a395b66d" data-w-id="a30b53a9-8d93-22bf-d534-87a8a395b66d" class="heading-style-h5">
One model under every tool.
</h3>
</div>
<p data-wf-id="a30b53a9-8d93-22bf-d534-87a8a395b66f" data-w-id="a30b53a9-8d93-22bf-d534-87a8a395b66f" class="body-3 text-color-iron">
A unified, real-time model of the plant feeds every application, analytics project, and AI agent you run. Your engineers’ knowledge shows up in any tool, every capability can reason over the whole plant, and everything new builds on the same foundation instead of starting from scratch.
</p>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="0927ea0f-b590-e0df-4346-f56a933bff90" data-w-id="0927ea0f-b590-e0df-4346-f56a933bff90" class="plantgraph_img is-large">
<img src={__lumosAsset15} alt="" data-wf-id="256092c6-9305-38cf-1998-73803e17ec90" data-w-id="256092c6-9305-38cf-1998-73803e17ec90" />
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
