<GTag>
The difference
</GTag>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc18" data-w-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc18" class="max-width-700">
<div data-wf-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc14" data-w-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc14" class="margin-bottom margin-12">
<h2 data-wf-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc15" data-w-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc15">
Not a data aggregation platform, not a workflow platform, not another model. The whole picture.
</h2>
</div>
<div data-wf-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc17" data-w-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc17" class="margin-bottom margin-64">
<p data-wf-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc19" data-w-id="0b113773-cbce-605e-632f-a8784c72fc19">
Platforms connect data to things and build on top. Cerebre models the plant itself. Equipment, flow, and facility-specific concepts within our plant construct. That's why every answer comes back in the context of the plant.
</p>
