<p data-wf-id="3218ad01-652a-b3b4-4310-b37def230a25" data-w-id="3218ad01-652a-b3b4-4310-b37def230a25" class="text-color-softgray">
Cerebre serves your plant model to the agents, models &amp; tools your team already uses.  With an ontology that turns equipment, lines, &amp; data into the concepts your engineers know and that agents can understand.  So your agents have the context to reason: trace upstream &amp; downstream, pull in work orders, procedures and live data, with your permissions carried along
</p>
